						<leaderTitleFemale>High Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>The blood cobra knows the strength that comes from drinking of blood. There is no greater strength than that which comes from human blood. If a tree falls in the forest, its spirit makes a sound that all other spirits can hear. It is prophesied that a sleeping traveler from the stars will crash to the earth, and the spirit of the crater will wake the traveller who will raise the last tribe.</description>
