						<description>"My family, my clan, my team - they all tried to keep a shroud over my eyes to stop me from seeing a simple fact: Each person is unique and valuable and must walk his or her own path. No one can argue with that."

  - &lt;i&gt;Life of a Manager&lt;/i&gt; by Hanna 'Maverick' Taylor</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>"My family, my clan, my team - they all tried to keep a shroud over my eyes to stop me from seeing a simple fact: Each person is unique and valuable and must walk his or her own path. No one can argue with that."

