						<leaderTitleMale>Top Thug</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Top Thug</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Persecuted and imprisoned, Takuya Cox boiled with rage. He escaped, formed his gang, and returned to ruin the weak who had taken so much from him. Takuya's followers demonstrated their devotion by cutting and burning their own flesh. Takuya went to commune with the animals in the fields and forests, and connected with them as equals.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Persecuted and imprisoned, Takuya Cox boiled with rage. He escaped, formed his gang, and returned to ruin the weak who had taken so much from him. Takuya's followers demonstrated their devotion by cutting and burning their own flesh. Takuya went to commune with the animals in the fields and forests, and connected with them as equals.</descriptionTemplate>
