					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Boccocarro</place>
							<deities>
								<li>
									<name>As-Salam</name>
									<type>Creator of All</type>
									<gender>Male</gender>
									<iconPath>UI/Deities/DeityGeneric</iconPath>
									<relatedMeme>Structure_OriginIslamic</relatedMeme>
								</li>
							</deities>
						</foundation>
						<name>Supreme Legion</name>
						<adjective>Archaeo-Caliphic</adjective>
						<memberName>Archaeo-Caliphist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Grand Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Grand Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;As-Salam&lt;/color&gt; guided humanity to Boccocarro, and helped them settle there. A mine hypervisor arose and threatened to destroy &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;As-Salam&lt;/color&gt; himself using a seismic quake-generation device. A warrior named Purple Human used a seismic quake-generation device to destroy a fungus cavern. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;As-Salam&lt;/color&gt; saw Purple's ruthlessness and anointed her the rightful ruler of all humanity. Purple gathered the Archaeo-Caliphists in a drip-well and taught them of &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;As-Salam&lt;/color&gt;'s wisdom.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>%%Deity0_name%% guided humanity to Boccocarro, and helped them settle there. A mine hypervisor arose and threatened to destroy %%deity0_name%% %%deity0_objective%%self using a seismic quake-generation device. A warrior named Purple Human used a seismic quake-generation device to destroy a fungus cavern. %%Deity0_name%% saw Purple's ruthlessness and anointed her the rightful ruler of all humanity. Purple gathered the %%memberNamePlural%% in a drip-well and taught them of %%deity0_name%%'s wisdom.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Corunan</culture>
