						<name>High Legion</name>
						<adjective>fleshist</adjective>
						<memberName>Fleshist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Divine Fist</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Divine Fist</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>The people of the steamy jungle-world Oubanyen lived under the high supervision of &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Reustor&lt;/color&gt;. Then the tree-harvester came. His henchmen killed many worshippers of &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Reustor&lt;/color&gt; with ikwas. A shaman named Luca 'Queen' Naii protested the tree-harvester by kneeling in front of the city temple and ripping all technology from her body using her bare hands. Queen destroyed the capital of Oubanyen with an archotech mass-inverter, killing the tree-harvester. She took her place as ruler of Oubanyen - and the universe beyond.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>The people of the steamy jungle-world Oubanyen lived under the high supervision of %%deity0_name%%. Then the tree-harvester came. His henchmen killed many worshippers of %%deity0_name%% with ikwas. A shaman named Luca 'Queen' Naii protested the tree-harvester by kneeling in front of the city temple and ripping all technology from her body using her bare hands. Queen destroyed the capital of Oubanyen with an archotech mass-inverter, killing the tree-harvester. She took her place as ruler of Oubanyen - and the universe beyond.</descriptionTemplate>
