						<name>Celestial Crew</name>
						<adjective>Forothic</adjective>
						<memberName>Forothite</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Prime Templar</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Prime Templar</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>In the days of darkness, &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Foroth&lt;/color&gt; saw that humanity was in need of guidance, and commanded her Forothites to build great ships. There was peace, until a crime boss and his thugs rebelled against &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Foroth&lt;/color&gt;'s dominion. The Forothites were forced to flee to a hidden manufacturing ring. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Foroth&lt;/color&gt; came to the 3D printer technician Ralph Bluetawn in a nightmare, and spoke to him about space. Ralph gathered the Forothites in a residential ring and taught them of &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Foroth&lt;/color&gt;'s wisdom.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>In the days of darkness, %%deity0_name%% saw that humanity was in need of guidance, and commanded %%deity0_possessive%% %%memberNamePlural%% to build great ships. There was peace, until a crime boss and his thugs rebelled against %%deity0_name%%'s dominion. The %%memberNamePlural%% were forced to flee to a hidden manufacturing ring. %%Deity0_name%% came to the 3D printer technician Ralph Bluetawn in a nightmare, and spoke to him about space. Ralph gathered the %%memberNamePlural%% in a residential ring and taught them of %%deity0_name%%'s wisdom.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Astropolitan</culture>
						<iconDef>RoundC</iconDef>
						<colorDef>DarkOlive</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.570, 0.470, 0.290, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
